题目内容：题目名称：Stonks
题目介绍：I decided to try something noone else has before. I made a bot to automatically trade stonks for me using AI and machine learning. I wouldn't believe you if you told me it's unsecure!
vuln.c nc wily-courier.picoctf.net 64780
提示：


